//   level 2), amershi2019software (model deployment sebagai tahap alur kerja).
// Ikon generik (bebas-tool), nama diverifikasi docs.eraser.io/docs/icons 2026-07-11.
// Rendering WAJIB horizontal (direction right), tanpa \rotatebox pada LaTeX.

direction right

// Aktor pengubah (batas)
Tim Pengembang [icon: users, color: gray, label: "Tim Pengembang (data dan model)"]

GitOps and Continuous Delivery Layer [icon: git-branch, color: blue] {
  source code repository [icon: git-branch]
  CICD component [icon: repeat, label: "CI/CD component"]
  deployment services [icon: share-2]
  model deployment [icon: upload]
}

// Tujuan rilis (batas)
Model Lifecycle Layer [icon: refresh-cw, color: purple, label: "Model Lifecycle Layer (model serving component)"]

// Rantai pengiriman berkelanjutan (kreuzberger2023mlops, googlecloud2024mlops)
Tim Pengembang > source code repository: commit perubahan
source code repository > CICD component: perubahan kode memicu build
CICD component > deployment services: artefak teruji
deployment services > model deployment: otomasi rilis model
model deployment > Model Lifecycle Layer: model rilis ke serving component
